#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:5
#: 64db73b6fd4046ee806496d7df9141e7
msgid "旧版层错位移（Legacy Stacking Fault）"
msgstr "Legacy Stacking Fault"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:7
#: 3ced708b101048189805d6caeb1c61a9
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:9
#: 9c20e67e160f4ff1b4c566b5e4562961
msgid "兼容性说明"
msgstr "Compatibility Notice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:11
#: 48131f660e1e479a85079a086a9ff194
msgid ""
"这张卡保留早期 NepTrainKit 的固定晶胞半区平移算法，用于载入和复现已有工作流。它的“切面一侧整体滑移”思路可以生成层错，也与常见 Atomsk "
"脚本采用同一种几何操作；问题在于卡片没有让用户显式指定滑移方向，切面参数也容易误解，因此不再出现在“添加新卡片”和“查找卡片”中。"
msgstr ""
"This card preserves the fixed-cell half-region translation algorithm used by early NepTrainKit releases so existing workflows can still be loaded and reproduced. Translating all atoms on one side of a cut can create a stacking fault and is the same geometric operation used by common Atomsk scripts. However, the card never lets the user specify the slip direction explicitly, and its cut-plane parameter is easy to misread, so it is no longer shown in `Add new card` or card search."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:13
#: 3c27429591294c848c8e4b4e72410477
msgid ""
"旧 JSON 中的 `StackingFaultCard` 仍可正常载入和运行。新任务请使用 `GSFE Path`（序列化类名仍为 "
"`StrictGSFEPathCard`）。后者显式要求："
msgstr ""
"Legacy JSON containing `StackingFaultCard` can still be loaded and run. For new work,"
" use `GSFE Path` (whose serialized class name remains `StrictGSFEPathCard`). It "
"explicitly requires:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:15
#: d0f0f881976c4a1ca4a1140de1ced407
msgid "当前晶胞的 `ab` 层错面；"
msgstr "the current cell's `ab` fault plane;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:16
#: b92a2ab1fac34502a5afbc9f9ede7e39
msgid "当前晶胞基矢下的面内方向；"
msgstr "an in-plane direction expressed in the current cell basis;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:17
#: f22d69e2765645939dab8ee14d075838
msgid "位移单位；"
msgstr "the displacement unit;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:18
#: 3737bfc2d8804af1854fc7115428465f
msgid "切面位置；"
msgstr "the cut position;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:19
#: a7ad8711a2b84e8b9e0d913f7747a488
msgid "输入晶胞与目标层错面的定向一致性。"
msgstr "whether the input cell is oriented consistently with the intended fault plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:21
#: cb2b9d306586411cbb15281a5557b719
msgid "旧版卡没有显式滑移方向，因此仅凭 `近似晶面 h k l`（`hkl`）无法定义一个物理滑移系。"
msgstr "The legacy card has no explicit slip direction, so `Approximate plane h k l` (`hkl`) alone cannot define a physical slip system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:23
#: 0c97ffd72b1546d19294a7d37243ac53
msgid "旧算法实际做什么"
msgstr "What the Legacy Algorithm Actually Does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:25
#: 91dca7954ec14681bb7c2d4379a64b9e
msgid "给定输入晶胞 $A$ 和 `hkl=(h,k,l)`，旧算法先用倒易晶格构造单位法向："
msgstr "Given input cell $A$ and `hkl=(h,k,l)`, the legacy algorithm first constructs a unit normal from the reciprocal lattice:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:27
#: a463a563aa37445ea21d337ae8376a12
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf n}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{h\\mathbf b_1+k\\mathbf b_2+l\\mathbf b_3}\n"
"{\\left|h\\mathbf b_1+k\\mathbf b_2+l\\mathbf b_3\\right|}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:34
#: 62f47214613c460bb2d03f827404a8b2
#, python-brace-format
msgid "随后从全局笛卡尔 x、y、z 轴中选择与 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ 最不平行的一根轴 $\\mathbf e$，并定义："
msgstr "It then chooses the global Cartesian x, y, or z axis $\\mathbf e$ that is least parallel to $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ and defines:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:36
#: 4d9231a71d4149faa95d827ebf32530c
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\hat{\\mathbf s}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\times\\mathbf e}\n"
"{\\left|\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\times\\mathbf e\\right|}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:43
#: b86e3c7b51104589b06727c877c90901
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"这个 $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ "
"是确定性的面内方向，但不是用户指定的晶向。只要它恰好等于目标滑移方向，旧算法生成的结构可以是有效层错；否则结果只是另一个方向上的层间错排。把同一物理晶体整体旋转后，所选方向还可能改变。"
msgstr ""
"This $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ is a deterministic in-plane direction, but it is not a user-selected crystallographic direction. If it happens to equal the intended slip direction, the legacy algorithm can produce a valid stacking fault; otherwise it creates an interlayer offset along another direction. Rotating the same physical crystal can also change the selected direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:45
#: 1fabb4550bed4b4e91e91ac249c3308c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"原子按投影 $q_i=\\mathbf r_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ "
"排序。`旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）选择第几个投影坐标作为阈值，并移动满足 $q_i\\ge q_\\mathrm{cut}$ 的原子。若 "
"`旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）超出投影层数，算法静默改用中间投影层。最后沿 $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ 施加绝对 Å 位移并把坐标折回周期晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Atoms are sorted by the projection $q_i=\\mathbf r_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf n}$. `Legacy projected-layer index` (`layers`) selects which sorted projection is used as the threshold, and atoms satisfying $q_i\\ge q_\\mathrm{cut}$ are moved. If `layers` exceeds the number of projected layers, the algorithm silently uses the middle layer. It finally applies an absolute displacement in Å along $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$ and wraps coordinates back into the periodic cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:47
#: 0120ea5634b1487a88b364a11decfb1d
msgid "因此旧卡的核心位移并非错误，但参数面不足以可靠表达任意滑移系："
msgstr "The core translation is therefore not inherently wrong, but the available parameters cannot reliably express an arbitrary slip system:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:49
#: 338ecb60206f471085acb51c41c3fb47
msgid "默认 `layers=1` 可能选中全部原子，只产生整体平移，没有形成相对层移；"
msgstr "the default `layers=1` may select every atom, producing only a rigid translation rather than relative layer slip;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:50
#: 6db19ca32333499a8505d0fe9c5b99f0
msgid "“层”由投影坐标四舍五入到 8 位后去重，不是带容差的晶体学层识别；"
msgstr "layers are deduplicated after rounding projected coordinates to eight decimal places, rather than identified with a crystallographic tolerance;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:51
#: bc60094d6cae492d8a489b8612b1c989
msgid "超范围层号不会报错，而会回退到中间层；"
msgstr "an out-of-range layer index falls back to the middle layer instead of reporting an error;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:52
#: 539051476b4241ffa829b2c1a8b10a77
msgid "`hkl=(0,0,0)` 会原样返回输入结构；"
msgstr "`hkl=(0,0,0)` returns the input structure unchanged;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:53
#: 157a1551273f4c539140e094b09eebc9
msgid "输出是否对应目标层错取决于自动方向是否恰好等于目标晶向；"
msgstr "the output matches the intended stacking fault only if the automatically chosen direction happens to equal the target crystallographic direction;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:54
#: e8d3d74c87a748a3a660233c4da55d60
msgid "卡片不检查输入晶胞是否已按目标晶面定向。"
msgstr "the card does not verify that the input cell is oriented for the target fault plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:56
#: 8d057abcac974bd5b45d8fbf02bc4c8f
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:58
#: ee411dd32a6b4d0fa25739455db6e568
msgid "近似晶面 h k l（hkl）"
msgstr "hkl"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:60
#: 36b81a1be62344e0ab6bc539e55eaa74
msgid "长度为 3 的整数序列，默认 `(1,1,1)`。只用于构造投影法向，不足以定义物理滑移系。"
msgstr "A length-three integer sequence, default `(1,1,1)`. It is used only to construct the projection normal and is insufficient to define a physical slip system."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:62
#: 14c9c452fb9d48e492d31ff2eee5f0b9
msgid "旧版投影层序号（layers）"
msgstr "layers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:64
#: cbe74fdb07804268baae5c913f5f28dd
msgid "`int`，默认 1，必须至少为 1。选择排序后的第 `旧版投影层序号`（`layers`）个投影坐标作为移动阈值；并不是“参与层错的层数”。"
msgstr "`int`, default 1 and at least 1. Selects the `layers`-th sorted projected coordinate as the movement threshold; it is not the number of layers participating in the fault."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:66
#: d0e8cc06df5e4bde83502c59ff4c4f06
msgid "位移（step）"
msgstr "step"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:68
#: 1f59d26848a14d30bf9f9c7826d09633
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"三个浮点数 `[start, stop, step]`，默认 `[0.0, 1.0, 0.5]`，单位 Å。每个值都是沿旧算法自动选择的 $\\hat{\\mathbf "
"s}$ 的绝对位移。"
msgstr "Three floats `[start, stop, step]`, default `[0.0, 1.0, 0.5]`, in Å. Each value is an absolute displacement along the legacy algorithm's automatically selected $\\hat{\\mathbf s}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:70
#: e56c6daf4c5546738dee2b53c6eb1ab7
msgid "兼容配置示例"
msgstr "Legacy Configuration Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:72
#: b1be9fe1dba24fcdaed6eef35a41bcdd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StackingFaultCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"hkl\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"    \"step\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.5],\n"
"    \"layers\": 2\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:84
#: 1d17ada308a649bfb331ee18684b35ff
msgid "该示例仅用于重现旧工作流。新任务应使用显式卡片，把晶面、滑移方向和切面分别写清楚。"
msgstr "This example is only for reproducing a legacy workflow. For new work, use an explicit card that records the plane, slip direction, and cut separately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:86
#: 4e6bb5b1eb0d4b9a95d9d70d0e726198
msgid "如何迁移到显式 GSFE"
msgstr "Migrating to Explicit GSFE"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:88
#: 26457e0ca2c44ee887698924bd2cc9b7
msgid "旧配置不能自动无损转换，因为其中没有记录滑移方向。迁移时需要根据材料和目标滑移系人工确定 `slip_uvw`，并重新检查切面。"
msgstr "A legacy configuration cannot be converted losslessly because it does not record the slip direction. During migration, determine `slip_uvw` manually from the material and target slip system, then recheck the cut plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:90
#: 7faef65032dd44288903aa89f14c7bd6
msgid "示意配置："
msgstr "Illustrative configuration:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:92
#: f9fa74d91d8e40abae12ae84cb029899
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StrictGSFEPathCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"plane_hkl\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"slip_uvw\": [1, 0, 0],\n"
"    \"displacement_range\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.1],\n"
"    \"displacement_unit\": \"fraction_of_vector\",\n"
"    \"cut_mode\": \"middle\",\n"
"    \"cut_fraction\": 0.5,\n"
"    \"layer_index\": 0,\n"
"    \"wrap\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:109
#: a599e1423c9548a685fcd7924edb0e41
msgid "这里的指数只是格式示例，不能直接照搬到具体材料。"
msgstr "These indices illustrate the format only and must not be copied directly to a specific material."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:111
#: f5322f56f8e74f128335930cdb4b0cea
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:113
#: fa1eb47cbf084d758fb6b309d9416e65
#, python-brace-format
msgid "SF(hkl={h}{k}{l},d={displacement})\n"
msgstr "SF(hkl={h}{k}{l},d={displacement})\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:117
#: d9a3f2af03df48eebfb36b4ccfd7ed85
msgid "标签表示旧算法参数，不证明输出是物理有效的层错或孪晶。"
msgstr "The label records legacy algorithm parameters; it does not prove that the output is a physically valid stacking fault or twin."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:119
#: e47a8a93a2804d3194b7cba78e533042
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:121
#: 5ea3000aedca47e79e8cb08d52b95f24
msgid "无随机性。同一坐标系中的同一输入和参数会得到一致输出；把结构旋转到另一笛卡尔取向后，结果不保证等价。"
msgstr "There is no randomness. The same input and parameters in the same coordinate frame produce the same output; rotating the structure to a different Cartesian orientation is not guaranteed to give an equivalent result."

#~ msgid "层错构型（Stacking Fault）"
#~ msgstr "Stacking Fault"

#~ msgid "功能说明"
#~ msgstr "What the card does"

#~ msgid "沿指定 Miller 晶面做相对滑移，生成不同位移量的层错结构。选定 hkl 晶面后，从指定层开始将上层原子整体平移，扫描位移步长覆盖堆垛错配路径。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate stacking-fault structures by shifting "
#~ "atoms above a selected layer relative to "
#~ "atoms below a Miller plane. Scan displacement"
#~ " along the in-plane slip path."

#~ msgid "操作示例"
#~ msgstr "Example workflow"

#~ msgid "场景：模型在层错能曲线上完全失真"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: The stacking-fault energy curve is qualitatively wrong"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 fcc Cu 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，体相弹性能和力都很好。然后你尝试算 "
#~ "(111) 面的广义层错能（GSFE）曲线——模型预测的层错能是 DFT 参考值的 3 "
#~ "倍，曲线形状也不对。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "An fcc Cu NEP reproduces bulk energies "
#~ "and forces but predicts a (111) GSFE "
#~ "three times too high with the wrong "
#~ "curve shape."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** GSFE "
#~ "曲线是体系在不同滑移位移下的能量响应。训练集里所有结构都是完美晶体，没有任何原子层之间发生了相对位移的构型。模型对\"层间滑移\"这个自由度的能量函数完全靠外推。需要沿目标滑移方向生成一组已知位移量的层错结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** GSFE measures energy as one "
#~ "part of a crystal slides relative to "
#~ "another. Perfect-crystal data contain no such"
#~ " degree of freedom. Add controlled displacements"
#~ " along the target slip system and label "
#~ "them with DFT."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 fcc Cu 的超胞，c 轴已沿 [111] 方向"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** An fcc Cu supercell with c aligned to [111]."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 沿 (111) 面，从 0 到 1.0 的位移范围，步长 0.1，生成 11 个层错构型"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Objective:** Generate 11 displacements from 0 "
#~ "to 1.0 Å in 0.1 Å steps on the "
#~ "(111) plane."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`Step` = `[0.0, 1.0, 0.1]`（单位 Å，沿面内滑移方向）"
#~ msgstr "`Step` = `[0.0,1.0,0.1]` Å along the in-plane slip direction."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出：** 11 个结构（位移 0.0, 0.1, 0.2, ..., "
#~ "1.0），上层原子相对下层整体平移指定距离，带 `SF(hkl=111,d=...)` 标签"
#~ msgstr "**Output:** Eleven shifted structures labeled `SF(hkl=111,d=...)`."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后重新计算 GSFE 曲线，形状和峰值应接近 DFT 参考"
#~ msgstr "After labeling and retraining, compare the full GSFE shape and peak with DFT."

#~ msgid "检查位移量最大的构型是否还保持合理键长（不会严重重叠）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect the largest displacement for atom "
#~ "overlap and plausible nearest-neighbor distances."

#~ msgid "如果只有一条滑移方向不够，换 `hkl` = 110 或 100 覆盖不同滑移系统"
#~ msgstr "Add separate hkl paths when other slip systems are in scope."

#~ msgid "步长太长可能漏掉能量鞍点——GSFE 场景建议步长 ≤ 0.05"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A coarse step can miss a saddle point;"
#~ " use 0.05 Å or finer when curve "
#~ "resolution requires it."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "模型对层错能、堆垛缺陷、滑移路径预测差"
#~ msgstr "Stacking-fault energies or slip paths are inaccurate"

#~ msgid "研究塑性、位错、相变相关的力学性质"
#~ msgstr "Plasticity, dislocations, or transformation mechanics are in scope"

#~ msgid "训练集只有完美晶格，缺少层间位移自由度样本"
#~ msgstr "Training contains only perfect lattices and no interlayer displacement"

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "体系不关心塑性/位错，只做弹性或振动性质"
#~ msgstr "Only elastic or vibrational properties are needed"

#~ msgid "体系不是层状或晶体结构（如非晶、分子液体）"
#~ msgstr "The system has no meaningful crystalline slip plane"

#~ msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 (1, 1, 1)。Miller 指数，定义你要切哪个晶面做滑移。"
#~ msgstr "`Sequence[int]`, default `(1,1,1)`. Miller indices of the slip plane."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "低指数面（111, 110, 100）是最常见的滑移系统，你应该先从这几个试起。中指数（222, "
#~ "311）对应次密排面，高指数（333+）是更高阶滑移系统——先用低指数验证通了再往上走。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Begin with physically relevant low-index slip"
#~ " planes such as 111, 110, or 100. "
#~ "Validate geometry and energy before adding "
#~ "higher-index paths."

#~ msgid ""
